@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml

title L1：发送生命周期状态图

[*] --> PREPARE
state "PREPARE\n校验 / enrich / route / encode" as PREPARE
state "DISPATCH\n选择 direct / reliable" as DISPATCH
state "PROVIDER_SEND\n调用 MessageProvider" as PROVIDER_SEND
state "CONFIRMED" as CONFIRMED
state "FAILED" as FAILED
state "REJECTED" as REJECTED
state "UNKNOWN" as UNKNOWN

PREPARE --> REJECTED : 参数 / 路由 / 编解码拒绝
PREPARE --> DISPATCH : 准备完成
DISPATCH --> PROVIDER_SEND : 进入发送
PROVIDER_SEND --> CONFIRMED : 明确确认
PROVIDER_SEND --> FAILED : 明确失败
PROVIDER_SEND --> UNKNOWN : 状态不确定
PROVIDER_SEND --> REJECTED : 明确拒绝
CONFIRMED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
UNKNOWN --> [*]
@enduml
